  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "のこされ　ひえきった　こうちゃに\nさみしがりやな　たましいが　やどり\nポケモンに　なったと　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "차게 식은 남은 홍차에\n외로움을 타는 영혼이 깃들어\n포켓몬이 되었다고 전해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說這隻寶可夢是因為\n害怕寂寞的靈魂住進了\n涼透的喝剩紅茶而誕生的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On raconte que ce Pokémon est né lorsqu’une\nâme esseulée a plongé dans un reste de thé noir\nfroid.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es heißt, eine einsame Seele habe Besitz von\neiner abgestellten, kalten Tasse Schwarztee\nergriffen und sei zu diesem Pokémon geworden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Según se dice, este Pokémon surgió de un alma\nsolitaria que poseyó una taza abandonada llena\nde un té ya frío.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che questo Pokémon sia nato quando\nun’anima solitaria si è impossessata di una\ntazza dimenticata piena di tè ormai freddo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon is said to have been born when\na lonely spirit possessed a cold, leftover cup\nof tea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "残され　冷えきった　紅茶に\nさみしがりやな　魂が　宿り\nポケモンに　なったと　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "据说这只宝可梦是因为\n害怕寂寞的灵魂住进了\n凉透的喝剩红茶而诞生的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Según se dice, este Pokémon surgió de un alma\nsolitaria que poseyó una taza abandonada llena\nde un té ya frío.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すみかに　している　ティーカップは\nゆうめいな　アンティークの　しょっき。\nおおくの　がんさくが　でまわっている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "거처로 삼고 있는 찻잔은\n유명한 골동품 식기다.\n위작이 많이 나돌고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "被牠當成住處的茶杯\n是有名的古董餐具。\n市面上有很多贗品。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il élit domicile dans des tasses de thé anciennes\nde grand renom. Parmi celles-ci se trouvent\nde nombreuses contrefaçons.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Teetasse, die es bewohnt, ist eine berühmte\nAntiquität. Es befinden sich allerdings auch viele\nFälschungen im Umlauf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La taza de té donde se hospeda forma parte de\nuna antigua y valiosa vajilla, de la que circulan\nnumerosas falsificaciones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La tazza da tè in cui vive è un vero pezzo\ndi antiquariato di cui circolano molte copie\ncontraffatte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The teacup in which this Pokémon makes its\nhome is a famous piece of antique tableware.\nMany forgeries are in circulation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すみかに　している　ティーカップは\n有名な　アンティークの　食器。\n多くの　贋作が　出回っている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "被它当成住处的茶杯\n是有名的古董餐具。\n市面上有很多赝品。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La taza de té donde se hospeda forma parte de\nuna antigua y valiosa vajilla, de la que circulan\nnumerosas falsificaciones.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "さびしく　しんだものの　たましいがのみのこしの　こうちゃに　とりついた。ホテルや　みんかに　あらわれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "외롭게 죽은 자의 영혼이 마시다 남은 홍차에 깃들었다. 호텔이나 민가에 나타난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "死於孤獨的死者之魂附在了喝剩的紅茶上。會在旅館或民宅出現。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon naît quand l’âme d’une personne esseulée prend possession des restes de thé noir. Il apparaît dans les hôtels et les maisons.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Seele eines einsam Verstorbenen hat von halb ausgetrunkenem Schwarztee Besitz ergriffen. Fatalitee zeigt sich in Hotels und Wohnhäusern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgen cuando el alma de alguien que haya muerto en soledad posee un té a medio beber. Aparecen en hoteles y residencias.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nasce quando l’anima di una persona morta in solitudine prende possesso di una tazza di tè lasciata a metà. Si palesa spesso in case e hotel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The soul of someone who died alone possessed some leftover tea. This Pokémon appears in hotels and houses.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "寂しく　死んだ者の　魂が飲み残しの　紅茶に　取り憑いた。ホテルや　民家に　現れる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "死于孤独的死者之魂附在了喝剩的红茶上。会在旅馆或民宅出现。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Surgen cuando el alma de alguien que haya muerto en soledad posee un té a medio beber. Aparecen en hoteles y residencias.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "のまれることで　からだに　はいりこみうちがわから　せいたいエネルギーをうばうのだ。　そのあじは　まずい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "마시면 몸 안으로 침투하여 안에서부터 생체 에너지를 빼앗는다. 맛은 없는 편이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會趁著自己被喝掉時進到對方身體裡，從內部奪走其生物能量。喝起來很難喝。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon s’infiltre dans le corps de quiconque le boit et lui dérobe son énergie vitale. Il a très mauvais goût.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon dringt in den Körper derjenigen ein, die von ihm trinken, und raubt ihnen von innen Lebensenergie. Es schmeckt scheußlich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si alguien lo bebe, entra en su cuerpo y le arrebata la energía vital desde dentro. Posee, además, un sabor espantoso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si infiltra nel corpo di chi lo beve, rubando le sue energie vitali dall’interno. Ha un sapore davvero pessimo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sinistea gets into your body when you drink it, and then it steals your vitality from within. It also tastes awful.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "飲まれることで　体に　入り込み内側から　生体エネルギーを奪うのだ。　その味は　不味い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "趁着自己被喝掉时进入对方身体里，从内部夺走对方的生物能量。味道很糟糕。",
      "language": {
